# Sequence Diagram
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
actor User
participant CLI
participant Validator
participant Model
participant Predictor
participant Recommendation
User->>CLI: Run prediction
CLI->>Validator: Validate record
Validator-->>CLI: Valid input
CLI->>Model: Load trained model
Model-->>CLI: Model
CLI->>Predictor: Predict
Predictor-->>CLI: Risk + confidence
CLI->>Recommendation: Generate suggestions
Recommendation-->>CLI: Suggestions
CLI-->>User: Display result
```
